{
    "_comment": "Milo in the Separated Village (after the Candy boss). Tense. NEUTRAL about the two ways (but hints: Factory = more/stronger WEAPONS, Tundra = more/stronger ARMOUR): Factory (portal down) or Tundra (passage). Whichever is entered, the way back closes until its boss is beaten (like Crimson/Corruption).",
    "partner": "milo",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_separated"
            },
            "goto": "again"
        },
        "first"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "first": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_separated"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Oh. You made it here too."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "This village is... quieter than mine. People here keep to themselves. They had their reasons."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "From here there are two ways. I can't pick for you. Wouldn't be fair."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "But listen. Whichever way you go in, it closes behind you. You don't come back until whatever lives there is beaten."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Closes? How?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "It just does. Some doors are like that."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "hub": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "So. What do you want to know?"
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Tell me about the Factory.",
                    "goto": "factory"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Tell me about the Tundra.",
                    "goto": "tundra"
                },
                {
                    "text": "What's under all of this?",
                    "goto": "under"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Thanks, Milo.",
                    "goto": "bye"
                }
            ]
        },
        "factory": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "The Factory's down there. Under the village. Toys, machines, conveyor belts that never stop."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Good: it's small. Rooms and corridors. You won't get lost for long."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Bad: it's dark, it's loud, and the toys don't always stay where you put them."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "And whatever they built down there, most of it shoots. If you want something that hits harder, that's where you'll find it."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "It also leads somewhere bigger. A lot bigger."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "tundra": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "The Tundra is north. Snow, pines, and a cold that gets into your bones and pays rent."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Good: it's open. You see what's coming. Fewer surprises."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Bad: it's big, it's empty, and walking in snow is slow. Also, cold. Did I say cold?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "People up there don't fight much. They just dress like the cold is out to get them. Thick coats, heavy armour. Whatever keeps you standing, it's up there."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "At the end there's a way down too. Same place the Factory leads to, from the other side."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "under": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo:asked_under"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Under? Dirt. Rocks. Roots. Normal under-stuff."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "That's not what I meant."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "scary",
                    "text": "I know what you meant.",
                    "voice": "scary",
                    "speed": 0.6
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "...Sorry. Long day. It's just dirt. Promise."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "bye": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Take care. Whichever way you pick... come back in one piece, okay?"
                }
            ]
        },
        "again": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Factory or Tundra. Hit harder or hold out longer. Loud or cold. Life is full of terrible choices."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "People here don't like to talk about the old days. Maybe don't ask them."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "I keep thinking about that question of yours. About what's under. Forget I reacted like that."
                },
                {
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Remember: in is easy. Out is the hard part."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Tell me about the ways again.",
                    "goto": "hub"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Bye.",
                    "goto": "end"
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
